  <p>To run this function the script must request the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PERMISSION_OVERRIDE_ANIMATIONS" target="_blank">PERMISSION_OVERRIDE_ANIMATIONS</a> permission with <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlRequestPermissions" target="_blank">llRequestPermissions</a>.</p>
  <p>Note: Animation overrides survive everything, except relog.</p>
